- Yes, but, but--

00:09:02.233 --> 00:09:03.133
- the giants.

00:09:03.133 --> 00:09:04.233
- They're all scared, right,

00:09:04.233 --> 00:09:06.433
and they're all aware,
and they're all impressed,

00:09:06.433 --> 00:09:09.000
and I think it gets compounded.

00:09:10.734 --> 00:09:14.066
It's just so impressive to watch
you build something so real

00:09:14.066 --> 00:09:18.233
and so big and compete
at the at a global scale...

00:09:19.266 --> 00:09:20.100
And what's interesting
is that you're going

00:09:20.100 --> 00:09:21.567
into a different chapter, right?

00:09:21.567 --> 00:09:23.367
You guys were this
digital-native brand,

00:09:23.367 --> 00:09:25.166
and now it's just
getting bigger and bigger.

00:09:25.166 --> 00:09:26.333
- For our main channel, yeah.

00:09:26.333 --> 00:09:28.333
- Yeah, and it's happening here.

00:09:28.333 --> 00:09:30.900
They know we're not
25 people anymore, right?

00:09:30.900 --> 00:09:33.367
So, you change.

00:09:33.367 --> 00:09:35.633
But, you don't change in spirit,

00:09:35.633 --> 00:09:37.900
you just look
differently at 12 and 17

00:09:37.900 --> 00:09:39.433
and 26 and what have you.

00:09:39.433 --> 00:09:40.700
How are you thinking
about the business?

00:09:40.700 --> 00:09:43.467
What's exciting?
What's interesting?

00:09:43.467 --> 00:09:46.367
Give us a quick, little update.

00:09:46.367 --> 00:09:50.000
- Well, I think
what's interesting about

00:09:50.000 --> 00:09:53.033
life in general,
it's something that,

00:09:53.033 --> 00:09:55.200
I guess I only really came to

00:09:55.200 --> 00:09:59.633
when I got older, was
I decided, at some point,

00:09:59.633 --> 00:10:02.000
that as right as
I ever thought I was

00:10:02.000 --> 00:10:04.834
when I was 18 telling my parents

00:10:04.834 --> 00:10:09.266
all the thoughts in the world
about how things should be, Dad.

00:10:09.266 --> 00:10:13.233
And I had all the opinions
and said all the things.

00:10:13.233 --> 00:10:18.133
I never wanted to be the same
person 10 years from then.

00:10:18.133 --> 00:10:22.433
And, as a company,
five years ago,

00:10:22.433 --> 00:10:24.333
we were a very
different company.

00:10:24.333 --> 00:10:26.166
And we've grown up.

00:10:26.166 --> 00:10:28.633
And I hope five years from now,

00:10:28.633 --> 00:10:30.767
we will be even more grown up.

00:10:30.767 --> 00:10:34.700
Now, having wisdom
doesn't mean that you should

00:10:34.700 --> 00:10:37.200
not have life and spirit.

00:10:37.200 --> 00:10:39.900
It doesn't mean that
you shouldn't be open

00:10:39.900 --> 00:10:43.700
and still try and learn
and change and evolve.

00:10:43.700 --> 00:10:46.066
It just means that you
have hopefully the wisdom

00:10:46.066 --> 00:10:48.967
to not make the same mistake
more than two or three times.

00:10:48.967 --> 00:10:49.800
(audience laughter)

00:10:49.800 --> 00:10:51.900
Because that just really blows,

00:10:51.900 --> 00:10:55.934
making the same
mistakes over and over again.

00:10:55.934 --> 00:11:00.200
We're an Omnichannel brand
as far as distribution goes.

00:11:00.200 --> 00:11:02.066
Our model has changed a bit.

00:11:02.066 --> 00:11:06.300
We are in more
verticals, more expansive

00:11:06.300 --> 00:11:07.433
as far as--

00:11:07.433 --> 00:11:09.066
- You're hardcore in the
beauty thing, now, right?

00:11:09.066 --> 00:11:10.433
- Yeah, we're in beauty.

00:11:10.433 --> 00:11:14.900
We're launching cleaning
at the end of the year.

00:11:14.900 --> 00:11:18.367
We started primarily
in baby and personal care

00:11:18.367 --> 00:11:21.500
and basic cleaning,
but we're really going

00:11:21.500 --> 00:11:24.166
deep in verticals
where we know we can win

00:11:24.166 --> 00:11:28.900
and where people
have asked us to play in.

00:11:28.900 --> 00:11:30.533
We've really kind of evolved

00:11:30.533 --> 00:11:32.867
into a health
and wellness company.

00:11:32.867 --> 00:11:34.066
At the end of the day,

00:11:34.066 --> 00:11:36.767
a company that
puts human health first,

00:11:36.767 --> 00:11:39.500
no matter what
category we go into.

00:11:39.500 --> 00:11:41.533
It really doesn't matter,

00:11:41.533 --> 00:11:45.000
and education is as important
as the products that we make,

00:11:45.000 --> 00:11:47.567
and just, you know,
being able to empower people

00:11:47.567 --> 00:11:49.467
with the knowledge
to make better choices,

00:11:49.467 --> 00:11:52.600
to me, is the ultimate mission.

00:11:52.600 --> 00:11:53.400
- So talk to me about,

00:11:53.400 --> 00:11:57.066
so this company
started from social, right?

00:11:57.066 --> 00:12:00.900
Talk to me about your personal
social media behaviors.

00:12:00.900 --> 00:12:01.600
How do you roll?

00:12:01.600 --> 00:12:03.734
Do you create like fake
accounts and troll people?

00:12:03.734 --> 00:12:04.567
You're a character,

00:12:04.567 --> 00:12:06.500
so I know something
weird could come out here.

00:12:06.500 --> 00:12:07.333
- You know, I tried to do that.

00:12:07.333 --> 00:12:08.467
I really tried to do it

00:12:08.467 --> 00:12:10.200
'cause I feel like
I have an alter ego.

00:12:10.200 --> 00:12:11.100
(audience laughter)

00:12:11.100 --> 00:12:12.934
And I tried to
have like, you know,

00:12:12.934 --> 00:12:17.233
my social media alter ego that's
like a little bit naughty.

00:12:17.233 --> 00:12:18.166
- Really?
(audience laughter)

00:12:18.166 --> 00:12:20.400
- But I couldn't do it.

00:12:20.400 --> 00:12:22.633
It was like too
