00:22:11.233 --> 00:22:13.734
- So, here's this weird thing,

00:22:13.734 --> 00:22:16.800
because I don't
come from traditional

00:22:18.033 --> 00:22:20.633
CPG or beauty background,

00:22:20.633 --> 00:22:23.567
I don't I never understood that

00:22:23.567 --> 00:22:26.233
the way that people
perceive your brand

00:22:26.233 --> 00:22:28.367
or the integrity of
your brand or whatever

00:22:28.367 --> 00:22:31.266
is based off of
distribution and not price point

00:22:31.266 --> 00:22:33.633
or the quality
of your ingredients.

00:22:33.633 --> 00:22:37.266
It literally, 100% has
to do with distribution.

00:22:37.266 --> 00:22:40.233
But now that distribution has
all but flipped on its head,

00:22:40.233 --> 00:22:42.934
with every D to C business

00:22:42.934 --> 00:22:45.900
and with all of
these online retailers

00:22:45.900 --> 00:22:48.233
