are in peoples' hands,

00:23:02.867 --> 00:23:06.066
and that my brand is

00:23:06.066 --> 00:23:07.900
showcased in the best way.

00:23:07.900 --> 00:23:12.000
So, I don't really have a bias
as to where I'm distributed.

00:23:12.000 --> 00:23:14.266
I just want it to
have really great partners,

00:23:14.266 --> 00:23:16.233
and I want it to
be done the right way.

00:23:16.233 --> 00:23:17.667
- She has been
doing something super rad.

00:23:17.667 --> 00:23:19.166
She's was doing Target Tuesdays?

00:23:19.166 --> 00:23:21.834
- Target Tuesdays,
I'm going into

00:23:21.834 --> 00:23:24.633
